AG.&gt;AS : AgentResult(Disruption, llmDerived = true)
..=f5
AS:[hallucinated station or malformed JSON]
AG.&gt;AS : AgentResult(success = false)
AS-&gt;AS + : keep Disruption(kind = UNKNOWN, confidence = 0)
--=f5; off=AG
